ap full of surprises. Every round is different, and anything can happen once the game begins.\n\nThe goal is simple: avoid getting tagged while trying to tag others when it\u2019s your turn. But Cuss Tag isn\u2019t just a normal game of tag. The environment is full of places to explore, objects to interact with, and plenty of opportunities to create hilarious moments with other players. You can run across the map, hide from the tagger, mess around with friends, or just enjoy the chaos happening around you.\n\nBecause players can do almost whatever they want, the game often turns into funny and unexpected situations. One moment you might be running for your life, and the next moment you\u2019re laughing with friends as everyone tries to escape the tagger. The unpredictable gameplay keeps every round exciting and different.\n\nWhether you want to compete, explore, or just hang out and have fun, Cuss Tag gives you the freedom to play your own way. Jump into the chaos, challenge other players, and see how long you can survive without getting tagged.\n\nRun fast, stay alert, and most importantly\u2026 don\u2019t get tagged!", "short_description": "Cuss Tag is a wild and chaotic tag game where anything can happen! Run, chase, and try to tag other players while surviving the madness around you. In this unpredictable world, you can do almost whatever you want \u2014 explore, mess around with friends, and create your own fun. Whether you're escaping the tagger or causing chaos, every round is different. Jump in, play your way, and see if you can survive the chaos of Cuss Tag!"}]}, "developer_name": "lilmonkeyvr", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ui7b659Z-_aFxp6Yfva-GRxry3aJUj-qCMiqbaya5SU/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "lilmonkeyvr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dBB6_RnurUIEXO2ZDNZzNpUQVJdrLQBl2zTw4z3HqxI/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "